<h1>04_动物与生物界 (Animals & Fauna)</h1>
<p style='color:#64748b;margin-bottom:14px;'>本大类共 <b>689</b> 词（分为 <b>7</b> 个折叠子表，已配图 <b>689</b> 张）• 法语模式已包含 <b>定冠词 le/la + 阴阳词性 (n.m./n.f.) + 雌雄双形态 + 特殊复数</b></p>
<div class="sub-nav"><button class='ctrl-btn' onclick='toggleAllSections(true)'>📂 全部展开</button><button class='ctrl-btn secondary' onclick='toggleAllSections(false)'>📁 全部收起</button><span style='color:#93c5fd;margin:0 4px;'>|</span><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_0')">01_哺乳动物 (222)</a><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_1')">02_鸟类与家禽 (112)</a><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_2')">03_爬行类与两栖动物 (59)</a><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_3')">04_鱼类与海洋脊椎生物 (52)</a><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_4')">05_昆虫与蛛形纲节肢动物 (125)</a><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_5')">06_甲壳类、贝类与软体蠕虫 (73)</a><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_6')">07_动物躯体部位、羽角与巢穴 (46)</a></div>
<details class='sub-section' id='sub_0' open><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>01_哺乳动物 (Mammals)</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 222 词 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='22%'>单词 (英 / 法性数完整形态)</th><th width='14%'>音标 (英 / 法 IPA)</th><th width='22%'>中文释义</th><th width='24%'>英文定义 (WordNet)</th><th width='6%'>词频</th><th width='12%'>实物配图</th></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>wolf</span><span class='word-fr-box'>le loup / la louve<span class='fr-pos-mf'>n.m./f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 wolf</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/wulf/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/lu / luv/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('wolf', 'le loup ,  la louve')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 狼, 残忍贪婪之人, 极度穷困</td><td class='def-en'>any of various predatory carnivorous canine mammals of North America and Eurasia that usually hunt in packs</td><td>4.35</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_1' data-word="wolf" src='images/wolf.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('wolf', 'animals', 'img_1')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>bull</span><span class='word-fr-box'>le taureau / la vache<span class='fr-pos-mf'>n.m./f.</span><span class='fr-pl-badge' title='不规则复数形式'>pl. taureaux</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 bull</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/bul/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/tɔʁo / vaʃ/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('bull', 'le taureau ,  la vache')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 公牛</td><td class='def-en'>uncastrated adult male of domestic cattle</td><td>4.34</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_2' data-word="bull" src='images/bull.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('bull', 'animals', 'img_2')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>mouse</span><span class='word-fr-box'>la souris<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 mouse</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/maus/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/suʁi/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('mouse', 'la souris')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 老鼠, 胆小羞怯的人, 鼠标</td><td class='def-en'>any of numerous small rodents typically resembling diminutive rats having pointed snouts and small ears on elongated bodies with slender usually hairless tails</td><td>4.31</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_3' data-word="mouse" src='images/mouse.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('mouse', 'animals', 'img_3')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>bat</span><span class='word-fr-box'>la chauve-souris<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 bat</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/bæt/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ʃovsuʁi/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('bat', 'la chauve-souris')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 蝙蝠, 球棒</td><td class='def-en'>nocturnal mouselike mammal with forelimbs modified to form membranous wings and anatomical adaptations for echolocation by which they navigate</td><td>4.3</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_4' data-word="bat" src='images/bat.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('bat', 'animals', 'img_4')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>beef</span><span class='word-fr-box'>le bœuf / la vache<span class='fr-pos-mf'>n.m./f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 beef</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/bi:f/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/bœf / vaʃ/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('beef', 'le bœuf ,  la vache')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 牛肉, 肌肉</td><td class='def-en'>cattle that are reared for their meat</td><td>4.29</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_5' data-word="beef" src='images/beef.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('beef', 'animals', 'img_5')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>sheep</span><span class='word-fr-box'>le bélier / la brebis<span class='fr-pos-mf'>n.m./f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 sheep</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ʃi:p/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/belje / bʁəbi/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('sheep', 'le bélier ,  la brebis')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 羊, 胆小者</td><td class='def-en'>woolly usually horned ruminant mammal related to the goat</td><td>4.19</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_6' data-word="sheep" src='images/sheep.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('sheep', 'animals', 'img_6')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>rat</span><span class='word-fr-box'>le rat<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 rat</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ræt/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ʁa/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('rat', 'le rat')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 鼠, 卑鄙的人, 破坏者, 变节者</td><td class='def-en'>any of various long-tailed rodents similar to but larger than a mouse</td><td>4.17</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_7' data-word="rat" src='images/rat.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('rat', 'animals', 'img_7')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
