<details class='sub-section' id='sub_1'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>02_鸟类与家禽 (Birds & Poultry)</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 112 词 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='22%'>单词 (英 / 法性数完整形态)</th><th width='14%'>音标 (英 / 法 IPA)</th><th width='22%'>中文释义</th><th width='24%'>英文定义 (WordNet)</th><th width='6%'>词频</th><th width='12%'>实物配图</th></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>duck</span><span class='word-fr-box'>le canard / la cane<span class='fr-pos-mf'>n.m./f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 duck</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/dʌk/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/kanaʁ / kan/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('duck', 'le canard ,  la cane')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 鸭子</td><td class='def-en'>small wild or domesticated web-footed broad-billed swimming bird usually having a depressed body and short legs</td><td>4.21</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_223' data-word="duck" src='images/duck.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('duck', 'animals', 'img_223')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>eagle</span><span class='word-fr-box'>l'ai<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 eagle</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'i:gl/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ɛ/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('eagle', 'l\'ai')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 鹰, 鹰状标饰</td><td class='def-en'>any of various large keen-sighted diurnal birds of prey noted for their broad wings and strong soaring flight</td><td>4.13</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_224' data-word="eagle" src='images/eagle.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('eagle', 'animals', 'img_224')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>chick</span><span class='word-fr-box'>la gonzesse<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 chick</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/tʃik/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/gɔ̃zɛs/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('chick', 'la gonzesse')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 小鸡, 小鸟, 竹帘</td><td class='def-en'>young bird especially of domestic fowl</td><td>4.08</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_225' data-word="chick" src='images/chick.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('chick', 'animals', 'img_225')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>owl</span><span class='word-fr-box'>le strigiformes<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 owl</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/aul/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/stʁiʒifoʁm/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('owl', 'le strigiformes')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 猫头鹰</td><td class='def-en'>nocturnal bird of prey with hawk-like beak and claws and large head with front-facing eyes</td><td>3.87</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_226' data-word="owl" src='images/owl.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('owl', 'animals', 'img_226')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>goose</span><span class='word-fr-box'>le jars / l'oie<span class='fr-pos-mf'>n.m./f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 goose</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/gu:s/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ʒaʁ / wa/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('goose', 'le jars ,  l\'oie')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 鹅, 雌鹅, 鹅肉, 弯把熨斗</td><td class='def-en'>web-footed long-necked typically gregarious migratory aquatic birds usually larger and less aquatic than ducks</td><td>3.84</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_227' data-word="goose" src='images/goose.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('goose', 'animals', 'img_227')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>swan</span><span class='word-fr-box'>la cygne<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 swan</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/swɒn/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/siɲ/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('swan', 'la cygne')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 天鹅, 天鹅星座, 有才华的诗人</td><td class='def-en'>stately heavy-bodied aquatic bird with very long neck and usually white plumage as adult</td><td>3.84</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_228' data-word="swan" src='images/swan.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('swan', 'animals', 'img_228')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>hawk</span><span class='word-fr-box'>le faucon<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 hawk</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/hɒ:k/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/fokɔ̃/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('hawk', 'le faucon')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 鹰, 掠夺者, 鹰派成员</td><td class='def-en'>diurnal bird of prey typically having short rounded wings and a long tail</td><td>3.81</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_229' data-word="hawk" src='images/hawk.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('hawk', 'animals', 'img_229')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>crow</span><span class='word-fr-box'>le corbeau<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='fr-pl-badge' title='不规则复数形式'>pl. corbeaux</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 crow</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/krәu/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/kɔʁbo/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('crow', 'le corbeau')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 啼叫, 乌鸦, 鸡鸣, 撬棍</td><td class='def-en'>black birds having a raucous call</td><td>3.8</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_230' data-word="crow" src='images/crow.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('crow', 'animals', 'img_230')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>ant bird<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>la thamnophilidae<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 ant bird</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ænt bә:d/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/tamnofilida/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('ant bird', 'la thamnophilidae')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>蚁鸟</td><td class='def-en'>any of various dull-colored South American birds that feeding on ants some following army ant swarms</td><td>3.79</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_231' data-word="ant bird" src='images/ant_bird.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('ant bird', 'animals', 'img_231')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>night raven<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>le bihoreau<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='fr-pl-badge' title='不规则复数形式'>pl. bihoreaux</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 night raven</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/nait ˈreɪvən/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/bioʁo/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('night raven', 'le bihoreau')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>夜渡鸦</td><td class='def-en'>nocturnal or crepuscular herons</td><td>3.78</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_232' data-word="night raven" src='images/night_raven.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('night raven', 'animals', 'img_232')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>penguin</span><span class='word-fr-box'>l'auk<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 penguin</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'pengwin/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ok/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('penguin', 'l\'auk')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 企鹅, 空军地勤人员</td><td class='def-en'>short-legged flightless birds of cold southern especially Antarctic regions having webbed feet and wings modified as flippers</td><td>3.78</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_233' data-word="penguin" src='images/penguin.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('penguin', 'animals', 'img_233')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>snow goose<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>l'oie blanche ''''<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 snow goose</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/snəu ɡu:s/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/wa blɑ̃ʃ /</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('snow goose', 'l\'oie blanche \'\'\'\'')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 雪雁</td><td class='def-en'>blue goose in the white color phase</td><td>3.78</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_234' data-word="snow goose" src='images/snow_goose.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('snow goose', 'animals', 'img_234')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>chicken hawk<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>le faucon<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 chicken hawk</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ˈtʃikin hɔ:k/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/fokɔ̃/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('chicken hawk', 'le faucon')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 指各种专抓小鸡的鹰; [粗俚]指专门挑选小男孩或年青男子做为性伙伴的男人; [政治]“草鸡鹰派”, 美国对那些强烈支持战争, 自己却从未参与过战争或其它军事行动的人, 特别是指逃避参战义务的政客、官僚或评论员。</td><td class='def-en'>nontechnical term for any hawks said to prey on poultry</td><td>3.75</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_235' data-word="chicken hawk" src='images/chicken_hawk.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('chicken hawk', 'animals', 'img_235')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>falcon</span><span class='word-fr-box'>le faucon<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 falcon</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'fɒ:lkәn/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/fokɔ̃/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('falcon', 'le faucon')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 隼, 猎鹰</td><td class='def-en'>diurnal birds of prey having long pointed powerful wings adapted for swift flight</td><td>3.74</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_236' data-word="falcon" src='images/falcon.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('falcon', 'animals', 'img_236')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>dove</span><span class='word-fr-box'>la colombe<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 dove</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/dʌv/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/kɔlɔ̃b/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('dove', 'la colombe')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 鸽子</td><td class='def-en'>any of numerous small pigeons</td><td>3.67</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_237' data-word="dove" src='images/dove.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('dove', 'animals', 'img_237')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
