<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>shark</span><span class='word-fr-box'>le requin<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 shark</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ʃɑ:k/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ʁəkɛ̃/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('shark', 'le requin')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 鲨鱼, 骗子</td><td class='def-en'>any of numerous elongate mostly marine carnivorous fishes with heterocercal caudal fins and tough skin covered with small toothlike scales</td><td>4.1</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_394' data-word="shark" src='images/shark.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('shark', 'animals', 'img_394')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
