<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>dolphin</span><span class='word-fr-box'>le dauphin<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 dolphin</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'dɒlfin/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/dofɛ̃/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('dolphin', 'le dauphin')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 海豚</td><td class='def-en'>large slender food and game fish widely distributed in warm seas (especially around Hawaii)</td><td>3.67</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_398' data-word="dolphin" src='images/dolphin.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('dolphin', 'animals', 'img_398')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
