<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>scorpion fish<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>la scorpaenidae<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 scorpion fish</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ˈskɔ:pi:ən fiʃ/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/skoʁpaenida/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('scorpion fish', 'la scorpaenidae')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>[医]蝎子鱼</td><td class='def-en'>marine fishes having a tapering body with an armored head and venomous spines</td><td>3.36</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_401' data-word="scorpion fish" src='images/scorpion_fish.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('scorpion fish', 'animals', 'img_401')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
