<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>blue catfish<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>la blue catfish<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 blue catfish</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/blu: 'kætfiʃ/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/bly katfi/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('blue catfish', 'la blue catfish')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>蓝鲶鱼；长鳍叉尾鮰</td><td class='def-en'>a large catfish of the Mississippi valley</td><td>3.34</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_403' data-word="blue catfish" src='images/blue_catfish.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('blue catfish', 'animals', 'img_403')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
