<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>bony fish<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>l'osteichthyes<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 bony fish</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ˈbəʊni: fiʃ/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ostɛʃti/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('bony fish', 'l\'osteichthyes')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>多骨[刺]鱼, 海鲢; 硬骨鱼</td><td class='def-en'>any fish of the class Osteichthyes</td><td>3.24</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_406' data-word="bony fish" src='images/bony_fish.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('bony fish', 'animals', 'img_406')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>common eel<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>l'anguille<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 common eel</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ˈkɔmən i:l/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ɑ̃gij/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('common eel', 'l\'anguille')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 鳝鱼</td><td class='def-en'>eels that live in fresh water as adults but return to sea to spawn; found in Europe and America; marketed both fresh and smoked</td><td>3.23</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_407' data-word="common eel" src='images/common_eel.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('common eel', 'animals', 'img_407')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
