<details class='sub-section' id='sub_4'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>05_昆虫与蛛形纲节肢动物 (Insects, Spiders & Bugs)</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 125 词 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='22%'>单词 (英 / 法性数完整形态)</th><th width='14%'>音标 (英 / 法 IPA)</th><th width='22%'>中文释义</th><th width='24%'>英文定义 (WordNet)</th><th width='6%'>词频</th><th width='12%'>实物配图</th></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>spider</span><span class='word-fr-box'>l'araignée<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 spider</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'spaidә/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/aʁeɲe/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('spider', 'l\'araignée')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 蜘蛛, 设圈套者</td><td class='def-en'>predatory arachnid with eight legs, two poison fangs, two feelers, and usually two silk-spinning organs at the back end of the body; they spin silk to make cocoons for eggs or traps for prey</td><td>4.25</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_446' data-word="spider" src='images/spider.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('spider', 'animals', 'img_446')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>bug</span><span class='word-fr-box'>l'insecte<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 bug</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/bʌg/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ɛ̃sɛkt/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('bug', 'l\'insecte')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 错误, 虫, 病菌, 缺陷, 窃听器, 癖好, 防盗报警器, 双座小汽车, 要人</td><td class='def-en'>general term for any insect or similar creeping or crawling invertebrate</td><td>4.2</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_447' data-word="bug" src='images/bug.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('bug', 'animals', 'img_447')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>bee</span><span class='word-fr-box'>l'abeille<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 bee</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/bi:/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/abɛj/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('bee', 'l\'abeille')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 蜜蜂, 聚会</td><td class='def-en'>any of numerous hairy-bodied insects including social and solitary species</td><td>4.09</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_448' data-word="bee" src='images/bee.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('bee', 'animals', 'img_448')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>drone</span><span class='word-fr-box'>la faux bourdon<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 drone</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/drәun/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/fo buʁdɔ̃/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('drone', 'la faux bourdon')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 雄蜂, 懒惰者, 嗡嗡的声音, 无人驾驶飞机(或船)</td><td class='def-en'>stingless male bee in a colony of social bees (especially honeybees) whose sole function is to mate with the queen</td><td>4.0</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_449' data-word="drone" src='images/drone.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('drone', 'animals', 'img_449')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>butterfly</span><span class='word-fr-box'>le papillon<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 butterfly</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'bʌtәflai/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/papijɔ̃/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('butterfly', 'le papillon')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 蝴蝶</td><td class='def-en'>diurnal insect typically having a slender body with knobbed antennae and broad colorful wings</td><td>3.93</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_450' data-word="butterfly" src='images/butterfly.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('butterfly', 'animals', 'img_450')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>ant</span><span class='word-fr-box'>la formicidae<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 ant</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ænt/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/foʁmizida/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('ant', 'la formicidae')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 蚂蚁</td><td class='def-en'>social insect living in organized colonies; characteristically the males and fertile queen have wings during breeding season; wingless sterile females are the workers</td><td>3.86</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_451' data-word="ant" src='images/ant.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('ant', 'animals', 'img_451')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>hard tick<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>l'ixodidae<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 hard tick</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/hɑrd tik/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ixodida/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('hard tick', 'l\'ixodidae')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>[医]硬蜱，硬体蜱</td><td class='def-en'>ticks having a hard shield on the back and mouth parts that project from the head</td><td>3.79</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_452' data-word="hard tick" src='images/hard_tick.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('hard tick', 'animals', 'img_452')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
