<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>assassin bug<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>la réduve<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 assassin bug</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ә'sæsin bʌg/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ʁedyv/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('assassin bug', 'la réduve')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>[医] 猎蝽</td><td class='def-en'>a true bug: long-legged predacious bug living mostly on other insects; a few suck blood of mammals</td><td>3.55</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_470' data-word="assassin bug" src='images/assassin_bug.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('assassin bug', 'animals', 'img_470')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
