<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>lice</span><span class='word-fr-box'>l'anoploure<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 lice</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/lais/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/anoplyʁ/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('lice', 'l\'anoploure')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 虱, 寄生虫, 小虫, (非正式)低贱的人, 不受欢迎的人, 卑鄙的人</td><td class='def-en'>wingless usually flattened bloodsucking insect parasitic on warm-blooded animals</td><td>3.21</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_509' data-word="lice" src='images/lice.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('lice', 'animals', 'img_509')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
