<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>larva</span><span class='word-fr-box'>la larve<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 larva</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'lɑ:vә/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/laʁv/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('larva', 'la larve')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 幼虫</td><td class='def-en'>the immature free-living form of most invertebrates and amphibians and fish which at hatching from the egg is fundamentally unlike its parent and must metamorphose</td><td>2.99</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_675' data-word="larva" src='images/larva.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('larva', 'animals', 'img_675')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
